  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The one-click jar no longer can be run as “one click”. You generally have to point the correct version of Java. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Last we maintain a version of the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "[jetty-console-maven-plugin",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " | ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/jetty-console"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ] as it is extremely old. Removing this could allow us to remove this repository too.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
